:"4ovGaNmq9Z0","path":"/artists/missy-elliot/tracks/lick-shots-vlooper-remix/","slug":"lick-shots-vlooper-remix","title":"Lick Shots (Vlooper Remix)","artist":{"slug":"missy-elliot","title":"Missy Elliot"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"6HHQNRsrLR0","slug":"146","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-146"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #146","artwork":"/images/episodes/146.jpg","content":"Joe Kay hits hard with 3 hours of HEAVY tracks on 1 hour of sleep\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThere is something for everybody in here. Lots of unreleased music + music that was forgotten about. Shouts to all the amazing people who tuned in to the live show. Every once in a while we like to make a post about the location of our radio listeners and it's always inspiring to see how many people are actually tuning in and the locations that they reside in. We can't even pronounce some of the cities/countries! Talk about worldwide. Lets keep it moving.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10814,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-09-28T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"mRnGpeJgVek","position":30,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Missy Elliot - Lick Shots (Vlooper Remix)","track":{"id":"4ovGaNmq9Z0","path":"/artists/missy-elliot/tracks/lick-shots-vlooper-remix/","slug":"lick-shots-vlooper-remix","title":"Lick Shots (Vlooper Remix)","artist":{"slug":"missy-elliot","title":"Missy Elliot"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"F65IztEdKlQ","slug":"158","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-158-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #158 w/ Kronika","artwork":"/images/episodes/158.jpg","content":"Joe Kay & Kronika hold it down with gems randing from unreleased to forthcoming material, plus forgotten classics. \n\n<!--more-->\nHere is our last the last show of 2013 and ending it with a BANG. \n\nEvery week just keeps getting better and better for us. The music, the accomplishments, and ideas just keep rising. \n\nThis week was supposed to be a ladies edition of Soulection Radio w/ Sasha Marie, Eden, and Kronika but Sasha and Eden both couldn't make it out this time along. \n\nWe'll catch you in 2014 and thank you again for your support. We appreciate you.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10838,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-12-28T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Kronika's Set + Interview","position":1}},{"id":"BsJ7FOoxiwM","position":4,"timestamp":"00:05:44","rawTrack":"Missy Elliot  - Hot Boyz (Spooky REFIX)","track":{"id":"NdpoaAezf7c","path":"/artists/missy-elliot/tracks/hot-boyz-spooky-refix/","slug":"hot-boyz-spooky-refix","title":"Hot Boyz (Spooky REFIX)","artist":{"slug":"missy-elliot","title":"Missy Elliot"},"artwork":""},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"nKLM9nMSNZM","slug":"222","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/station/episode-222/ra.1081593078","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-222-ft-oshi"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #222 ft. Oshi","artwork":"/images/episodes/222.jpg","content":"An interview and guest DJ set from Oshi.\n\n\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":6904,"location":"US","published_at":"2015-08-22T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"EgfTo-uvvkI","position":0,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Missy Elliot - Friendly Skies","track":{"id":"q3Ta-l-4FHE","path":"/artists/missy-elliot/tracks/friendly-skies/","slug":"friendly-skies","title":"Friendly Skies","artist":{"slug":"missy-elliot","title":"Missy Elliot"},"artwork":"images/artists/missy-elliot/tracks/friendly-skies.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"UZiLM-EWFQ8","slug":"322","tags":[6